      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/WriteSPINASProcess"]}], "SeeAlso"],
  Cell["Related Guides", "MoreAboutSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["Constructing and Completing Amplitudes",
